WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Ryu blocks the first standing heavy kick before the held heavy rain Super.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.900
The shimmy baits Ryu’s throw; the second heavy kick scores Punish Counter.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.900
Standing medium kick and light Sun Rise juggle alongside the rain while held light Sun Flare refills two Crests.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.800
OD Sun Flare spends the refilled Crests and relaunches Ryu.

5
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.400
A dash into medium Sun Rise completes the recorded branch.
